      "id": "29hepsc",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Non‑Communicable Diseases"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "djx7472",
      "content": "• Diabetes – High blood sugar levels."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Diseases and Immunity",
      "id": "y76jepc"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7zp9ljy",
      "content": "• Hypertension – High blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pia62cp",
      "content": "• Cancer – Uncontrolled cell division."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "udydj58",
      "content": "• Heart disease – Affects heart function."
    },
    {
